{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17113","headline":"圆灵水镜 · 徐敞","name":"圆灵水镜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浮光上东洛，杨彩满圆灵。\n明灭沦江水，盈虚逐砌蓂。\n不分沙岸白，偏照海山清。\n练色临窗牖，蟾光霭户庭。\n成轮疑璧影，初魄类弓形。\n远近凝清质，娟娟出衆星。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐敞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17113.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17113","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}